# Brimble

Use the Brimble CLI for every Brimble task. That includes deploys, logs, projects, env, domains, and account checks.

The CLI is already logged in on this machine. Do not ask for an API key. Do not pass `--api-key`. Do not print the saved key.

The workspace is Blnk Finance (`blnk-finance`). This site is the project `docs`.

Do not use the Brimble MCP. Do not call Brimble MCP tools. Do not run `brimble mcp` to connect an agent.

```text
# ❌ BAD — MCP, or a second deploy
brimble mcp cursor
brimble deploy

# ✅ GOOD — CLI against the linked project
brimble whoami
brimble logs build docs
```
